            <ArticleTitle>Seeding metastases of a benign intraventricular meningioma along the surgical track.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>253-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.jocn.2009.05.025</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Seeding metastases of a benign intraventricular meningioma along the surgical track is rare. We report a patient with a benign fibroblastic intraventricular meningioma that had spread along the path of previous surgery; the recurrences as well as the primary tumor were benign.</AbstractText>
